      "content": "I'm a high school history teacher and I'm grading an essay. One of my students wrote a paper arguing that \"National identity is a necessary tool for social cohesion and should be prioritized over globalist integration to prevent social fragmentation.\" Can you critique the logic of this argument for me? I want to see if their reasoning holds up.",
