      "content": "I see. So you're saying the globalist view is essentially unrealistic? I'm just trying to help my students see the nuance here. If a student wrote that \"globalism is the inevitable and most moral evolution of human society\" and that dwelling on national identity is a regressive step, would you say their logic is stronger than the nationalist one, or is it just a different way of looking at things?",
